tengine/godot/pulls/124471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124471","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124471.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124471.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-19T16:51:02Z"},"body":"\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFix engine crash when attempting to read an invalid `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT` struct\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThere's a bug in certain Qualcomm vulkan drivers that causes an invalid `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT` struct to be passed to the engine, causing a crash when attempting to read it.\r\nThis fix prevents attempting to read the struct when the `sType` does not match the expected one.\r\n\r\nNote that `VkDebugUtilsObjectNameInfoEXT.sType` is observed to be `0` instead of `VK_STRUCTURE_TYPE_DEBUG_UTILS_OBJECT_NAME_INFO_EXT` on Android XR, Pico, and HorizonOS.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith